      "writtenOn": "2023-12-01T20:53:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think security considerations should be the first step.  There should be no ranging done if the security isn\u0027t high enough.  No need to trust the app to do the right thing with insecure data.",
      "parentUuid": "27b8b67f_c0b6eb19",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 56,
        "startChar": 18,
